{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q421212","formula":"Cl₃La","hill":"Cl3La","elements":["Cl","La"],"composition":{"Cl":3.0,"La":1.0},"names":{"en":"Lanthanum chloride","ru":"Хлорид лантана(III)"},"descriptions":{"en":"Lanthanum chloride is the inorganic compound with the formula LaCl3. It is a common salt of lanthanum which is mainly used in research. It is a white solid that is highly soluble in water and alcohols.","ru":"Хлорид лантана(III) — бинарное неорганическое соединение, соль металла лантана и соляной кислоты с формулой LaCl3, бесцветные кристаллы, растворимые в воде, образует кристаллогидрат. Относится к группе химических соединений трихлоридов лантаноидов с формулой LnCl3, где Ln обозначает металл-лантаноид."},"fame":20,"pubchemCid":64735,"mass":245.26,"charge":0,"smiles":"Cl[La](Cl)Cl","inchikey":"ICAKDTKJOYSXGC-UHFFFAOYSA-K","iupac":"trichlorolanthanum","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"crystal","source":"materialsproject","ref":"mp-22896","atoms":8,"license":"CC BY 4.0, Materials Project"},"structure":{"cell":[[7.544,0.0,0.0],[-3.772,6.533,0.0],[0.0,0.0,4.372]],"kind":"crystal","atoms":[{"x":3.772,"y":2.178,"z":3.279,"el":"La"},{"x":0.0,"y":4.356,"z":1.093,"el":"La"},{"x":1.978,"y":4.55,"z":3.279,"el":"Cl"},{"x":4.592,"y":3.988,"z":1.093,"el":"Cl"},{"x":1.794,"y":1.983,"z":1.093,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-0.82,"y":2.546,"z":3.279,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-1.157,"y":5.971,"z":3.279,"el":"Cl"},{"x":4.929,"y":0.562,"z":1.093,"el":"Cl"}],"bonds":[[0,4,1],[1,2,1],[1,6,1],[0,3,1],[0,7,1],[1,5,1],[0,2,1],[1,4,1]],"cellOrigin":[0,0,0]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q421212","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lanthanum%28III%29_chloride","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia